<view class="page">
  <view class="page-head">
    <view class="page-eyebrow">离线工具 / 材料冲片计算</view>
    <view class="page-title">历史记录</view>
    <view class="page-desc">结果只保存在当前微信的本机缓存中，最多 500 条。清理微信缓存、卸载小程序或更换手机会丢失，建议定期导出 JSON 备份。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">筛选历史 <text class="unit">材质、方式、数量或日期</text></text>
      <input class="input" value="{{query}}" placeholder="输入关键词" bindinput="onFilterInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onBackup">备份 JSON</button>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onRestore">恢复备份</button>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{status}}" class="status {{statusError ? 'is-error' : ''}}">{{status}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <text class="section-title">记录明细</text>
      <text class="section-sub">{{countText}}</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{records.length === 0}}" class="empty">
      <text class="empty-symbol">◇</text>
      <text>{{emptyText}}</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="list-item">
      <view class="item-head">
        <view class="item-main" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="onToggleDetail">
          <text class="item-number">{{item.quantityText}} 个</text>
          <text class="item-meta">{{item.meta}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="item-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="onRecalculate">重算</button>
          <button class="btn btn-danger btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="onDelete">删除</button>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{item.expanded}}" class="item-detail">
        <view class="kv-grid">
          <view wx:for="{{item.detailPairs}}" wx:for-item="pair" wx:key="key" class="kv-item {{pair.wide ? 'kv-wide' : ''}}">
            <text class="kv-label">{{pair.key}}</text>
            <text class="kv-value">{{pair.value}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:else class="detail-toggle" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="onToggleDetail">查看原始输入、参数快照和结果 ›</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="note">
    <text class="note-title">关于「重算」</text>
    重算使用当前「参数维护」中的数值重新生成一条新记录，原历史记录保持不变，便于对比参数调整前后的差异。
  </view>
</view>
